REQ-PRODUCTION-005,IMPLEMENTED,587,588,,"PR #588 implements Handoff/05 sections 16-17 and 26 deterministic Phase-5 production/extraction: stable ProductionUnit ordering; realized batches are bounded by the current ProductionPlan, exact live INPUT stock, Phase-3 allocated labor, effective capacity and finite regional resource deposits; shared deposits are reserved/depleted exactly once; exact recipe inputs decline and exact output enters ProductionUnit OUTPUT before the canonical reserve-based SELL intent is built. Region finite-resource balance is a persistent live compatibility seam initialized from immutable RegionSeed deposits on first Phase-5 use and thereafter carried only through the explicit immutable WorldState transition, so depletion cannot reset to scenario seed. applyProductionExecutionTransition validates unit/region/recipe provenance and exact physical deltas and rejects input/resource overdraw, missing recipe consumption and phantom output. Focused regressions in src/simulation/productionExecution.test.ts prove independent input/labor/capital/resource bottlenecks, finite depletion and zero-after-depletion, shared-resource no-double-spend, exact once-only stock transitions, output-first sale intent, non-ACTIVE suppression, forged-delta refusal, malformed/stale/cross-group evidence rejection, insertion-order determinism and input-world immutability. No random production multiplier, labor refund, market-clearing rewrite, investment/capital formation, lifecycle behavior, M5+ behavior or mirror edit is claimed."
